================================================================================
3. EXCEPTIONS -- material not covered by the licences above
================================================================================

CornellX ENGR2000X course material
    The simulations were built alongside CornellX ENGR2000X on edX. Geometry and
    case setup supplied by that course is Cornell's copyrighted teaching material.
    For that reason no ANSYS project archives (.wbpj / .wbpz) are included in this
    repository, and the diagrams in the write-ups are original renderings rather
    than reproductions of Cornell's slides. Nothing in this licence grants any
    right to Cornell's material.

Experimental validation data
    The NACA 0012 surface pressure and force data used for validation are from the
    NASA validation resources -- Gregory & O'Reilly for surface pressure, Ladson
    for force coefficients. Those datasets belong to their originators and are
    referenced, not redistributed.

ANSYS
    ANSYS is licensed commercial software and is not included or redistributed
    here. The work shown was produced under an ANSYS Student licence, whose mesh
    size limits are noted in the write-ups.
